<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-24T01:45:55.987Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 01:45:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have charged a prosecutor with treason for alleged US involvement in a drug raid, while a Texas man was indicted for purchasing firearms in Amarillo to supply the Sinaloa Cartel. A Sinaloa Cartel transporter pleaded guilty to trafficking methamphetamine and marijuana, and another smuggler admitted moving tens of thousands of pounds of drugs in federal court. The AI-powered intelligence platform that tracked the death of El Mencho is now being used to locate the next cartel boss. The conflict’s historical toll includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1YbDJKVkgwanhsakpXQmY3cy01aUlDa0hRTWU4a0hyNUZsamxSejJuNnNVRW1zWGtmVGsxdkZKdnU0Z2V6aGxLM0cwbExVNV9VR0FRQ2hLRi1XUDVneUloRnNYQ2lFVndRazhiQjlnRjFJbmZDWU5HMWd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;CTV News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;KVII&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KWTX&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WPDE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBmdk8wdmxyS0FsQ1J6VU9LY2VOR1h4YU5kdy1iU2d6RHlJOHd4TVR3U0ZDdGVCSjRRZTdXbC10VFFoMHBialZaRVR3dk1iQ19pajltTkkyRm9Rd3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Britannica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxON0p1aW53cXRHeUhrOHp4OUVGVkNodkFUNHlkQlp4NmNvcy1EYUNvLThfU3B4aGNFZWNqbHlRMmRlVlhESnJiREZmRU9aWEFyVHpER0